[{"time": 28.973, "text": "刚刚！！！！！", "mode": 1, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "2433479b"}, {"time": 31.44, "text": "来了来了，已经拿下了。", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "90dd5323"}, {"time": 143.82, "text": "生化危机是吧！", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "f551deec"}, {"time": 1.511, "text": "58分钟前", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8cfd6b01"}, {"time": 53.381, "text": "后面应该还会联动棱花要出的机械动力", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5c6bc15d"}, {"time": 23.691, "text": "10块钱对于这玩意的性价比来讲真的不贵，可惜我现在只剩100钻了，加上短时间内不可能充钱，唉", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "89910c26"}, {"time": 35.551, "text": "过小年立马拿下！", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "edea509"}, {"time": 45.023, "text": "手机啊，那没事儿了", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ca33665f"}, {"time": 78.259, "text": "真的不会卡死吗？", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c7f22483"}, {"time": 23.291, "text": "模组叫什么？为什么我搜不到？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e17206c6"}, {"time": 82.513, "text": "5555555没钱", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7c48ddbd"}, {"time": 37.621, "text": "还有热成像，但是僵尸为什么是热的", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a4b35d70"}, {"time": 45.252, "text": "700已入手", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "82a45449"}, {"time": 66.13, "text": "不还有个免费的吗？为什么要用棱花", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7ef4638b"}, {"time": 58.95, "text": "ps：其实是700钻，会员能300拿折扣券", "mode": 5, "color": 41194, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "23f8435"}, {"time": 145.325, "text": "然后食物食用动画看饿了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "25dd247d"}, {"time": 11.383, "text": "10块钱", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5e0cd7f0"}, {"time": 32.24, "text": "亡世界", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5e0cd7f0"}, {"time": 24.395, "text": "惊变三角洲风格，亡者世界是暗区风格", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "98aad0f9"}, {"time": 208.589, "text": "DAYZ", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7e11fe54"}, {"time": 75.745, "text": "这个入手啊，我是hmcl入手的", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e4ec9c6"}, {"time": 18.102, "text": "比特萝卜那个包要22块钱", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1b3be8d7"}, {"time": 14.707, "text": "其实是16因为还有个再去扩展要六块钱", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "baa2f14a"}, {"time": 57.326, "text": "吓我一跳,我原来看到尼普拉斯他家的新枪械,我还以为亡者世界只是一个惊变包,枪械什么的要重新买", "mode": 1, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e2f2ff88"}, {"time": 34.602, "text": "拿下了，真好", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d9bbc8c7"}, {"time": 74.993, "text": "nb", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a8e92ab4"}, {"time": 9.04, "text": "E这个是plus更新之后的。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8a3e239f"}, {"time": 0.0, "text": "那以前的呢？", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c6935eca"}, {"time": 0.0, "text": "那以前的惊变呢", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c6935eca"}, {"time": 127.191, "text": "建议打开自然回血，不然的话食物很容易爆仓", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 135.666, "text": "模组中的所有3d物品都有检视动画，个别的还有奇怪的音效，向上抛，没接住，没接住，钢管落地，胜利音效加捡起，以上是形容词", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 202.824, "text": "食物非常多，随便搜几个房子就有一大堆，不开消耗宝石度自动回血的话，食物很容易爆仓，相反水就没那么容易了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 312.637, "text": "还会受到体力的影响，如果耗的体力太多的话，也会消耗", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 336.931, "text": "就算煮开了也仍然会有病毒残留，最好还是喝建筑里搜刮来的矿泉水和其他饮料", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 167.986, "text": "玩的时候每次听到喝完饮品后的那一声就绷不住", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "3fc8a081"}, {"time": 348.303, "text": "这里建议把每个小方框都点一遍，不然很容易会遗漏一些不显眼的", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "3fc8a081"}, {"time": 324.187, "text": "BGM：breathe", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6d573ab6"}, {"time": 5.18, "text": "以前的挂转转上回收了", "mode": 5, "color": 9843, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "577311fb"}, {"time": 198.528, "text": "生活调味品？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5138f26"}, {"time": 50.706, "text": "会员权益可以在俱乐部那里领到，1000钻的打折卡，能够整成700钻（应该是目前最低的入手价了）", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 154.691, "text": "用手机没找到这个界面", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "b1420de1"}, {"time": 69.265, "text": "物品管理器有免费的", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "193baec0"}, {"time": 119.877, "text": "谁家僵尸毁灭工程", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a8684c2f"}, {"time": 90.378, "text": "真的非常好玩，强烈推荐啊", "mode": 1, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "468103dc"}, {"time": 103.619, "text": "入手了，很好玩", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1878e394"}, {"time": 164.579, "text": "有啥降维打击的，不就是塔科夫么。。。。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "cec17526"}, {"time": 356.796, "text": "一般来说建筑里一堆各种吃的喝的，压根不愁饱食度和口渴值，我反正就随一路走到哪吃喝到哪，搜到食物多少都会去吃掉一些", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c0c78910"}, {"time": 347.256, "text": "背景音乐叫什么名字？挺好听的", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c55457f3"}, {"time": 152.186, "text": "还有很好玩的食物，比如黑土豆，可口可乐，百事可乐。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e17206c6"}, {"time": 38.47, "text": "拿下了，内容简直是个整合包", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d47d33cf"}, {"time": 21.519, "text": "逃离塔克夫:亡者世界", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d735943b"}, {"time": 43.48, "text": "我靠 这模组玩过呀 电脑版免费 ", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c278af11"}, {"time": 10.606, "text": "感觉可以当mc版版本的毁僵了", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "99491ee3"}, {"time": 22.506, "text": "爽在哪？我一进去就死了，丧尸都不知道从哪里来", "mode": 5, "color": 41194, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8ab639b4"}, {"time": 37.299, "text": "塔科夫急救包啊", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "75e508f4"}, {"time": 164.374, "text": "音效塔科夫的啊", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "75e508f4"}, {"time": 12.128, "text": "已取餐", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a3fdef19"}, {"time": 71.382, "text": "入了！", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a31172a9"}, {"time": 43.584, "text": "网易啊，没事了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "230c9eb"}, {"time": 20.9, "text": "实则吃饭的时候没有这么多动作", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "143da067"}, {"time": 232.447, "text": "我点开天赋后退不出去了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6d569818"}, {"time": 33.709, "text": "我朋友请我玩了", "mode": 1, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1c3b28cf"}, {"time": 157.639, "text": "这应该是网易 Java", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7d9d297c"}, {"time": 62.41, "text": "jei几年前还全是免费的……", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c2ef23e2"}, {"time": 151.513, "text": "现在与mi4c的更好的hud会产生食物回不了饱食度及其他", "mode": 4, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "63648b33"}, {"time": 128.768, "text": "手机版的话建议加亮亮显示类模组，不然体验感很差", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "fe9457b2"}, {"time": 260.972, "text": "为啥我是直接死不是变僵尸", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "fe9457b2"}, {"time": 297.6, "text": "手机不好的看任务可能会有卡顿", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "fe9457b2"}, {"time": 239.99, "text": "的确开了之后就退不出去，不过呢现在修好了。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e17206c6"}, {"time": 359.703, "text": "到处是饮料还怕口渴啊", "mode": 5, "color": 9843, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "eb01a2a4"}, {"time": 189.325, "text": "网易最近开始发力了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ff3a81b1"}, {"time": 332.68, "text": "注:其实可以用营火烧水", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "bb6e21c1"}, {"time": 273.573, "text": "这样对极限模式玩家来说非常的不友好。", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "90659d06"}, {"time": 10.969, "text": "我也有这个。还是我好友送的。", "mode": 5, "color": 15772458, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c872c309"}, {"time": 98.514, "text": "卡", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "f22e40ce"}, {"time": 93.771, "text": "我是不是听到了cod16的击杀音效？", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "48bd316a"}, {"time": 242.774, "text": "？这是真僵毁", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c2571795"}, {"time": 28.051, "text": "啊现在", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "bae4a1b1"}, {"time": 74.75, "text": "有点心动了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ffb403f5"}, {"time": 12.169, "text": "我有这个模组", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ed127a41"}, {"time": 227.454, "text": "到后面太难升了难的要死", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c716c032"}, {"time": 0.191, "text": "全整合包20块但是真的精品", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8c76c81"}, {"time": 82.428, "text": "可惜不能联动红石", "mode": 1, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "35f3d4c5"}, {"time": 16.151, "text": "时间会证明电锯", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "258d8df"}, {"time": 321.417, "text": "还有不要钱的跳跃药水", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6e4dd062"}, {"time": 169.215, "text": "你知道吗？这是手机版我的世界，上面刷什么塔克夫也有这是我的世界，又不是塔克夫", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "df781993"}, {"time": 119.942, "text": "意志坚定在设置中可以关的", "mode": 5, "color": 41194, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ff832092"}, {"time": 152.656, "text": "为什么我点了没反应", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "77885367"}, {"time": 194.142, "text": "草药你跟我讲可以吃，但是我吃了很久压根就没动过", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa4ab6a6"}, {"time": 206.726, "text": "网易刚出的时候，体力条没有什么用", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa4ab6a6"}, {"time": 60.991, "text": "我读书少，你不要骗我。这两个模组都买了，坐等联动", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "48acdbb1"}, {"time": 49.984, "text": "我3000钻买了。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "fd628fad"}, {"time": 62.686, "text": " 这不是免费的吗还是我记错了？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1774d3e1"}, {"time": 272.318, "text": "←那你可能是把死亡立即重生打开了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5f1ab8ea"}, {"time": 0.0, "text": "", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "<function Danmaku.crack_uid at 0x00000271A5360880>"}, {"time": 649.585, "text": "Java版直接用的机械动力", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "627ffa90"}, {"time": 362.612, "text": "哪个清风的也行嘛！", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "dfa5511"}, {"time": 717.63, "text": "还有露希尔", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "49c207bc"}, {"time": 615.149, "text": "蔬菜的一辈子", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d5ed6e9"}, {"time": 568.694, "text": "哇！还有韧性", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f4eb0e3"}, {"time": 568.694, "text": "只狼", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f4eb0e3"}, {"time": 691.052, "text": "这是哪个游戏来着？哦！对呀，原来是我的世界！", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f4eb0e3"}, {"time": 569.755, "text": "这个好，好玩", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6dd0d91f"}, {"time": 598.185, "text": "现在就去买", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6dd0d91f"}, {"time": 633.471, "text": "估计后面还会和棱花的机械动力联动", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5c6bc15d"}, {"time": 627.12, "text": "红石的惊变也要重做，蔬菜成功跌落神坛", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5c6bc15d"}, {"time": 661.183, "text": "竟然还有匠魂的事", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "46ade572"}, {"time": 563.836, "text": "电次?", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e59745cc"}, {"time": 688.674, "text": "懂了，甲修", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6bc74c56"}, {"time": 577.268, "text": "挺像明日之后的 ", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ed72d4f2"}, {"time": 557.301, "text": "tqbs里的国王长剑", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c3a16f22"}, {"time": 402.728, "text": "所以这个模组越早买越好，什么背包啊，枪械啊里面都包含。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e17206c6"}, {"time": 616.169, "text": "这太厉害了，这一点都不卡呀我这个手机只有64的内存，而且已经用了好几年了现在内存还剩10.54差不多我玩这个测试的时候好家伙太流畅了，流畅的我都差点被吓哭了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "19942cb1"}, {"time": 637.397, "text": "两个都想要，怎么办？马上过年了，很快就可以冲上了", "mode": 1, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "9473cf7"}, {"time": 690.444, "text": "甲修了后甲掉耐久没", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a8d4fb1d"}, {"time": 381.607, "text": "为什么我的奖励和任务目标都是没有的", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ee9337ea"}, {"time": 568.848, "text": "敌人失衡！", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ca86ac41"}, {"time": 477.006, "text": "这不潜兵的骷髅头吗？只是把颜色变白了", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "da2adfad"}, {"time": 627.045, "text": "因为你没玩到后面 后面会肯定越来越卡的", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "da2adfad"}, {"time": 607.712, "text": "或许这是一款很温馨的模组", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "75b3b691"}, {"time": 430.887, "text": "前面的不用怕，我这出土文物一样的，手机也能运行的", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 510.081, "text": "危险品僵尸绝对是前期玩家的噩梦，跟玉面手雷王一样，炸弹根本扔不完，好不容易打死了，还来个自爆", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 513.724, "text": "PVZ2可以无限撞击后的全明星僵尸幻视）", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7b114ef0"}, {"time": 394.144, "text": "这个背包不支持左键shift的快速存取玩着挺难受的（", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "3fc8a081"}, {"time": 575.809, "text": "只狼说是", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d566c1c5"}, {"time": 423.664, "text": "被僵尸抓到会感染吗", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "2d4eeb3f"}, {"time": 442.47, "text": "警局全是吃的和子弹", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ba163e86"}, {"time": 445.072, "text": "一个装备武器都搜不到", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ba163e86"}, {"time": 376.307, "text": "用硅的话有些物品点击不给获取方式应该是还没完全适配，也有一种可能是那些物品只能自然生成", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5112d70f"}, {"time": 460.806, "text": "电锯人", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e4f6a7df"}, {"time": 566.171, "text": "电次，不要开门", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e4f6a7df"}, {"time": 437.162, "text": "npc呢？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5b712135"}, {"time": 543.804, "text": "666还有电锯人的事", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8e8d20d5"}, {"time": 474.06, "text": "？我开局就找到了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c0c78910"}, {"time": 561.753, "text": "这不电锯人吗", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "62f2b6ae"}, {"time": 574.123, "text": "敌人失衡，威龙失智()", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "9ff3322a"}, {"time": 399.973, "text": "这个背包巨卡 ", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5d436c6c"}, {"time": 674.178, "text": "前面那个弹幕莫名其妙，没玩过好的说是，java出于开发适配性只会更精美，更何况亡者世界本来就是java移植的…", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "94b54130"}, {"time": 559.139, "text": "枪之恶魔来了？", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "42cf8db9"}, {"time": 477.437, "text": "买了，打算开个房间", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "4f879a0"}, {"time": 710.144, "text": "电锯超吵", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "4f879a0"}, {"time": 487.424, "text": "这个b gm好像是超神学院的", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5c544ad1"}, {"time": 572.568, "text": "我要6豆", "mode": 5, "color": 16646914, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8112dc96"}, {"time": 506.24, "text": "spider！", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "bf30c080"}, {"time": 522.232, "text": "滚木僵尸", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "691fca1a"}, {"time": 575.643, "text": "哇，还有架势条。", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d2e5a3da"}, {"time": 524.75, "text": "哎呦喂，一堆苦力怕", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "3560ff9"}, {"time": 539.911, "text": "这好像是半锯人", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "3000a5c2"}, {"time": 693.984, "text": "是僵尸毁灭工程(ﾟ3ﾟ)～♪", "mode": 5, "color": 11890, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8d63f5f"}, {"time": 370.731, "text": "如果出生时的安全区处在山地的话，地形就会变得很坎坷", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "11e27b46"}, {"time": 453.355, "text": "好像还可以直接用铁钉烧钢，但是我没试过", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "11e27b46"}, {"time": 438.901, "text": "适合搭配超级英雄模组一起玩还原丧尸宇宙", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a601a8a0"}, {"time": 612.829, "text": "很难想象，末世之前，这个城市有多么繁华，多么温暖……直到人们的避风港将他们反手压死，他们才开始审视自己的罪恶", "mode": 4, "color": 9843, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e17f91a8"}, {"time": 550.761, "text": "旋转僵尸绷不住了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7bbffb1"}, {"time": 668.689, "text": "招笑工作量大", "mode": 1, "color": 41194, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "349138cb"}, {"time": 478.012, "text": "城市生成居然能跟种子绑定?", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "faa8a7b9"}, {"time": 695.812, "text": "可以把KID-UX和KID-NEXT一块加，模组武器是指令给于伤害，不适配有伤害读取的动作优化", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "41acc3e2"}, {"time": 455.62, "text": "警局的那个隔离门后面基本上必刷一把手枪", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c6bc5b92"}, {"time": 623.331, "text": "重复都是那几栋楼", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "4410b211"}, {"time": 491.412, "text": "就是", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7baa7c62"}, {"time": 453.734, "text": "等等，那有没有给下界和末地添加内容啊", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "89b8d1be"}, {"time": 655.807, "text": "我有时候放不了，硬是重启，或者偶尔碰运气", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa3bae01"}, {"time": 380.521, "text": "这里求歌名，", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "696ac3c6"}, {"time": 618.89, "text": "我游玩的时候生成的路都通向墙", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "9cdb485e"}, {"time": 676.453, "text": "钢太难找了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5b395c29"}, {"time": 392.797, "text": "所以我们要尽快的打开创造", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "12950226"}, {"time": 582.302, "text": "那会儿打Boss的时候不知道有防护板结果打着打着突然变僵尸了awa", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c716c032"}, {"time": 647.07, "text": "这里说一下钢是通过烧铁块获得的", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c716c032"}, {"time": 402.094, "text": "背包建议换个模组，不冲突", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "436fdef"}, {"time": 600.939, "text": "只要不加太多模组就行", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7f22ebf7"}, {"time": 598.979, "text": "中配可以的就是切有3d模型模组物品的时候会卡一下", "mode": 1, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8be879fb"}, {"time": 397.315, "text": "而且还不能快速整理有点难受", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d688cd89"}, {"time": 666.295, "text": "放不了有可能是模组冲突了", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d688cd89"}, {"time": 560.006, "text": "这里建议带几个盾牌来打，原版MC盾牌机制还是很强的", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ff832092"}, {"time": 446.345, "text": "南山校长办公室里面有钻石和下界合金", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "421d8504"}, {"time": 676.904, "text": "注意，这两个版本的接口不一样，基岩的效果相对于java难实现很多", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ab9a9c01"}, {"time": 388.909, "text": "现在的模组容器上面没有僵尸了   3月28日", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa4ab6a6"}, {"time": 403.098, "text": "手机版也是↓", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa4ab6a6"}, {"time": 490.402, "text": "日历和收音机竟然还可以互动(震惊", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa4ab6a6"}, {"time": 615.056, "text": "这么强？", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "aa4ab6a6"}, {"time": 689.809, "text": "我还以为是盾", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "db71053b"}, {"time": 735.08, "text": "艾尔登法环！！！", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f4eb0e3"}, {"time": 900.987, "text": "学废了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f4eb0e3"}, {"time": 900.987, "text": "合集：《一分钟模组简评》", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f4eb0e3"}, {"time": 785.562, "text": "3060→", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 18, "user_hash": "f39cdc7c"}, {"time": 848.104, "text": "我甚至还傻愣愣的在找载具在哪原来需要加这东西", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a805b739"}, {"time": 787.34, "text": "我的老年手机还是有点卡", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "fca05f59"}, {"time": 778.083, "text": "依旧cod", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "48bd316a"}, {"time": 778.083, "text": "致敬传奇素材库——cod", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "48bd316a"}, {"time": 835.67, "text": "武装十！", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "f7709a52"}, {"time": 730.118, "text": "就没有一个模组的电锯是左右挥砍吗一定都是要长按", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "763c3605"}, {"time": 802.214, "text": "手机的UI真的很奇怪，打开物品栏之后才会有而且打了X折之后，他就跟着消失了，那个会被挡住视野，所以建议做或者把那个删了添加一个专门的入口", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "19942cb1"}, {"time": 899.247, "text": "学费了，反正我只听到了，他要将近20块（体验完整内容的话）", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "19942cb1"}, {"time": 788.814, "text": "有概率卡出超高移速的bug", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "2e4d09f7"}, {"time": 855.886, "text": "猫猫车", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "7f54ec83"}, {"time": 891.02, "text": "巨石雨。。。", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "82cccff7"}, {"time": 765.581, "text": "三角洲嘛？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "3f0d8f02"}, {"time": 787.633, "text": "我在评论区问了我这刚出土的文物手机能运行吗？大伙都说出土文物需要上交国家，然后现在试了一下，根本不卡你能想象吗？一个这么大体量的模组一点都不卡", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c34bd8d"}, {"time": 809.365, "text": "所以说滑铲去哪里了？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "4a09dbd8"}, {"time": 889.964, "text": "陨铁可以合成牛肉面面的陨铁锻造里面的枪械吗？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "958f431b"}, {"time": 794.45, "text": "是的，他家这个模组真的不卡，我只加了王者世界和军械库，玩起来非常非常流畅", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "34b9a4ff"}, {"time": 901.686, "text": "学会了", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1f36b904"}, {"time": 892.801, "text": "666去做替身之箭了", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "a601a8a0"}, {"time": 824.64, "text": "已经试过了，确实可以看到哦，挺不错的，在狭窄过道里跟朋友一起开手电打尸潮有一股求生之路的感觉", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "c0c78910"}, {"time": 756.586, "text": "这刀光效果关不掉 好烦的 ", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5d436c6c"}, {"time": 886.799, "text": "可能性不高，毕竟网易你飞高了就看不见地面了", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "bc2918ce"}, {"time": 740.399, "text": "这个亡者世界里面可以左右砍，也可以长按", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "cdac2247"}, {"time": 829.7, "text": "猫猫车？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "ec277945"}, {"time": 810.725, "text": "666还有T", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5f5f23a0"}, {"time": 841.787, "text": "这款模组才¥10", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "29639593"}, {"time": 836.16, "text": "武直10，国产武装直升机", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "4d48c9b1"}, {"time": 801.189, "text": "我记得这个打到墙上还会有暂时的弹孔", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "f3093abc"}, {"time": 794.948, "text": "把怪物的生成拉满的话卡顿还是蛮明显的，切枪时也会有卡顿", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "9f0a0260"}, {"time": 859.973, "text": "手机真不推荐玩载具，玩不会", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "9f0a0260"}, {"time": 726.536, "text": "点击输入文本", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "67564bba"}, {"time": 878.108, "text": "依旧手搓", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "cd3d6af9"}, {"time": 746.06, "text": "手机有", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "5f827ae8"}, {"time": 752.965, "text": "手机端怎么弄改装没有I键啊", "mode": 5, "color": 41194, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "8f6efb21"}, {"time": 778.121, "text": "蓝图可以在枪械台里面合", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "1a469b4c"}, {"time": 876.937, "text": "天啊是直10ME大人", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "208bae59"}, {"time": 766.107, "text": "正片开始", "mode": 5, "color": 15138834, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "49a56fd9"}]